  "question": {
    "text": "If for some <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>, all have positive sign, one of the roots of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>q</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is also a root of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is equal to-",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "272",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>q</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>On simplifying we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>q</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>q</mi><mi>p</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>r</mi><mi>q</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>q</mi><mi>p</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>r</mi><mi>q</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; [because roots of&nbsp;equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math>]</p><p>As <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>r</mi></math>&nbsp;are positive,&nbsp;so&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> must be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>.</p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>p</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>p</mi></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>256</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>272</mn></math>.</p></blockquote>",
